{"PageNumber":218,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":10,"SurahIndex":"010","VerseNumber":79,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَقَالَ فِرۡعَوۡنُ ٱئۡتُونِي بِكُلِّ سَٰحِرٍ عَلِيمٖ","TajweedText":"وَقَالَ فِرْعَوْنُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>ئْتُونِى بِكُلِّ سَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>حِرٍ عَل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مٍ <span class=end>٧٩</span>","End":"٧٩","PageNumber":218,"JuzNumber":11,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":179,"MaqraNumber":87,"HizbNumber":22,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":10,"SurahIndex":"010","VerseNumber":80,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَلَمَّا جَآءَ ٱلسَّحَرَةُ قَالَ لَهُم مُّوسَىٰٓ أَلۡقُواْ مَآ أَنتُم مُّلۡقُونَ","TajweedText":"فَلَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َا ج<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّحَرَةُ قَالَ لَه<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ُّوسَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ىٰٓ</tajweed> أَلْقُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> م<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ُّلْق<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٨٠</span>","End":"٨٠","PageNumber":218,"JuzNumber":11,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":179,"MaqraNumber":87,"HizbNumber":22,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":10,"SurahIndex":"010","VerseNumber":81,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَلَمَّآ أَلۡقَوۡاْ قَالَ مُوسَىٰ مَا جِئۡتُم بِهِ ٱلسِّحۡرُۖ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ سَيُبۡطِلُهُۥٓ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَا يُصۡلِحُ عَمَلَ ٱلۡمُفۡسِدِينَ","TajweedText":"فَلَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَلْقَوْ<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> قَالَ مُوسَىٰ مَا جِئْت<tajweed class=ikhafa_shafawi>ُم ب</tajweed>ِهِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سِّحْرُ‌ۖ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</t